    gameId: 'mort-la-morte',
    icon: '💡',
  },
  data: {
    LLM: "Avoid leading La Morte! Since it loses if led off-trump, it is a defensive card. Use it to kill an opponent's high trump lead. If you are the contract maker, your goal is to draw out the opponents' trumps before they can use La Morte against your high side-suit cards.\n\nThe 'Drop Out' Risk: If you have a terrible hand, choice 'Drop Out' in the bidding. Your goal is 0 tricks. This is safer than bidding 1 and failing, as it guarantees you 'Defense' points if the contract maker fails.\n\nTiming the Death: Use 'La Morte' to make an opponent 'Il Morto' when they are the strongest. By forcing them to win a non-trump trick with your La Morte, you remove their high cards from the remaining tricks, effectively handing the game to yourself or your partner.",
    Player: "Avoid leading La Morte! Since it loses if led off-trump, it is a defensive card. Use it to kill an opponent's high trump lead. If you are the contract maker, your goal is to draw out the opponents' trumps before they can use La Morte against your high side-suit cards.\n\nThe 'Drop Out' Risk: If you have a terrible hand, choice 'Drop Out' in the bidding. Your goal is 0 tricks. This is safer than bidding 1 and failing, as it guarantees you 'Defense' points if the contract maker fails.\n\nTiming the Death: Use 'La Morte' to make an opponent 'Il Morto' when they are the strongest. By forcing them to win a non-trump trick with your La Morte, you remove their high cards from the remaining tricks, effectively handing the game to yourself or your partner.",
